<title>USA: Great Lakes to add Chicago-South Dakota.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes to add Chicago-South Dakota.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Minn. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Lakes Aviation Ltd said Thursday it will add United Express service between Huron, South Dakota and Chicago's O'Hare International Airport beginning March 1.</p>
<p>On weekdays, two round trips via Sioux Falls, South Dakota, will be scheduled replacing the current service to Minneapolis/St. Paul, the airline said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
